        "content": "## Phase 10 – Error Handler\nRuns automatically when any workflow that has this set as its **Error Workflow** fails. Logs the failure to the **Error Log** sheet (Date, Workflow, Failed Node, Error Message, Execution ID, Execution URL, Mode, Status) and emails an alert to the test account.",
